d></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>onset_date</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p> </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>additional_detail</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p> </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>end_date</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p> </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>end_reason</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p> </p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>creator</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>Who has entered these conditions</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>date_created</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>Date of creation of these conditions</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><br/></p>",
